<attribute name="purpose" nodeId="ec23a8ba">To clearly articulate the benefits of the proposed product to the stakeholders as well as provide the team&amp;nbsp;with
a&amp;nbsp;sense of purpose, guidance and connection to the product.</attribute>
<attribute name="impactOfNotHaving" nodeId="127dc7b8"></attribute>
<attribute name="reasonsForNotNeeding" nodeId="8c425308"></attribute>
<attribute name="briefOutline" nodeId="30a07ebc">&lt;p&gt;
    The Product Vision can take many forms but will generally detail the:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Purpose or intended change
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Target customer(s) or user(s) of the product
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Needs or&amp;nbsp;concerns of the stakeholders presenting an opportunity
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Benefit(s) derived by developing the product
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Distinguishing features of the product setting it apart from others
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
